<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="<%= admin_locale %>">
  <head>
    <title><%= content_for(:title) || "CS Studio" %></title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
    <%= csp_meta_tag %>
    <%= render "shared/theme_head" %>
    <%= stylesheet_link_tag "tailwind", "data-turbo-track": "reload" %>
    <%= javascript_importmap_tags %>
  </head>

  <%# CS Studio's shell (cs-studio spec §4.2): a grid of up to three columns --
      modules, an optional page tree, and the main content frame.
      `data-admin-locale` carries the editing language onto <body> (rather
      than one data attribute per component) so any Stimulus controller can
      read it via `closest` without a server round trip. Only the modules
      column is real yet -- the tree column (`content_for :tree`) and the
      resource controllers that fill `content` arrive in Tasks 3-7; until
      then this grid quietly collapses to two columns.

      The modules column itself collapses to icons below `md` (spec §4.2):
      the grid's own first track narrows from a fixed 16rem to `auto`, and
      `nav_link_classes` below centers each row's icon once its text label
      (kept in the DOM as `sr-only`, so the link's accessible name is
      unchanged -- just not painted) has nowhere to go. %>
  <body data-admin-locale="<%= admin_locale %>" class="min-h-screen bg-paper font-cs text-ink scheme-light dark:scheme-dark">
    <% nav_link_classes = "flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-cs px-2 py-1.5 hover:bg-sunken md:justify-start" %>
    <div class="grid min-h-screen grid-cols-[auto_1fr] md:grid-cols-[16rem_1fr]<%= " lg:grid-cols-[16rem_18rem_1fr]" if content_for?(:tree) %>">
      <nav aria-label="Modules" class="flex flex-col gap-6 border-r border-line bg-surface p-4">
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <%# `admin_url_options` on every one of these (final-fixes round,
              finding 5): without it, following a modules link while editing
              a non-default language silently dropped back to
              `Locales.default` -- these three are the one navigation in
              the whole shell that doesn't already run through a component
              (`Admin::TreeNodeComponent#path`, `Admin::LanguageSwitcherComponent`,
              ...) that threads it through for its own links already. %>
          <li>
            <%= link_to admin_root_path(**admin_url_options), class: nav_link_classes do %>
              <%= render "admin/shared/icon", name: :pages %><span class="sr-only md:not-sr-only">Pages</span>
            <% end %>
          </li>
          <li>
            <%= link_to admin_posts_path(**admin_url_options), class: nav_link_classes do %>
              <%= render "admin/shared/icon", name: :posts %><span class="sr-only md:not-sr-only">Posts</span>
            <% end %>
          </li>
          <li>
            <%= link_to admin_tags_path(**admin_url_options), class: nav_link_classes do %>
              <%= render "admin/shared/icon", name: :tags %><span class="sr-only md:not-sr-only">Tags</span>
            <% end %>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div>
          <%# One shared icon marks the whole "old admin" group (rather than
              one per Avo link): it's a temporary section (design spec
              2026-09-26, "Replace Avo") that goes away once Tasks 4-7 give
              Pages/Posts/Tags/Settings their own CS Studio screens, so it
              isn't worth a bespoke icon per link. Its own sub-links stay
              text-only and `hidden` below `md`, rather than also collapsing
              to icons, since four indistinguishable icon-only rows would be
              no more usable than no row at all. %>
          <p class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-cs-mono text-label uppercase tracking-mono text-meta md:justify-start">
            <%= render "admin/shared/icon", name: :external %><span class="sr-only md:not-sr-only">(old admin)</span>
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-2 hidden flex-col gap-2 md:flex">
            <li><%= link_to "Settings", "/avo/resources/site_settings" %></li>
            <li><%= link_to "Users", "/avo/resources/users" %></li>
            <li><%= link_to "API tokens", "/avo/resources/api_tokens" %></li>
            <li><%= link_to "System status", "/avo/system_status" %></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-auto flex flex-col gap-2">
          <%= render "shared/theme_toggle" %>
          <%= button_to admin_sign_out_path, method: :delete, class: nav_link_classes do %>
            <%= render "admin/shared/icon", name: :external %><span class="sr-only md:not-sr-only">Sign out</span>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <% if content_for?(:tree) %>
        <aside id="tree-column" class="border-r border-line bg-surface p-4">
          <%= yield :tree %>
        </aside>
      <% end %>

      <main class="p-6">
        <turbo-frame id="content" data-turbo-action="advance">
          <%= yield %>
        </turbo-frame>
      </main>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
